    {
      "source": "JPA specific configuration extension parsing custom attributes from the XML namespace and\n<a href=\"EnableJpaRepositories.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.config\"><code>EnableJpaRepositories</code></a> annotation. Also, it registers bean definitions for a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/support/PersistenceAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa.support\"><code>PersistenceAnnotationBeanPostProcessor</code></a> (to trigger injection into <code>PersistenceContext</code>/\n<code>PersistenceUnit</code> annotated properties and methods) as well as\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/annotation/PersistenceExceptionTranslationPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.annotation\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslationPostProcessor</code></a> to enable exception translation of persistence specific\nexceptions into Spring's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a> hierarchy.",
      "translation": "JPA 特定的配置扩展用于从 XML 命名空间和 `<a href=\"EnableJpaRepositories.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.config\"><code>EnableJpaRepositories</code></a>` 注解中解析自定义属性。此外，它还注册了以下 Bean 定义：一个 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/support/PersistenceAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa.support\"><code>PersistenceAnnotationBeanPostProcessor</code></a>`（用于触发向带有 `<code>PersistenceContext</code>` 或 `<code>PersistenceUnit</code>` 注解的属性和方法注入），以及一个 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/annotation/PersistenceExceptionTranslationPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.annotation\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslationPostProcessor</code></a>`，以启用将持久化特定异常转换为 Spring 的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a>` 层次结构的异常翻译功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/config/RepositoryRegistrationAotProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryRegistrationAotProcessor</code></a> implementation that maintains aot repository setup but skips domain\ntype inspection which is handled by the core framework support for\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/persistenceunit/PersistenceManagedTypes.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa.persistenceunit\"><code>PersistenceManagedTypes</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/config/RepositoryRegistrationAotProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryRegistrationAotProcessor</code></a> 实现，它维护 AOT 仓库配置，但跳过领域类型检查，该检查由核心框架对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/persistenceunit/PersistenceManagedTypes.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa.persistenceunit\"><code>PersistenceManagedTypes</code></a> 的支持处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
